{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pain-T is an exploration-driven metroidvania where color is your greatest weapon. The world has been drained of its color, and it has to be restored. As you explore and bring life back to the environment, hostile creatures will stand in your way, determined to stop your mission. Unleash amazing powers, uncover hidden paths, and paint your own destiny</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713500/extras/85ad46e21af43d40ba635f6cb604b58f.poster.avif?t=1763758286\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713500/extras/85ad46e21af43d40ba635f6cb604b58f.webm?t=1763758286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713500/extras/85ad46e21af43d40ba635f6cb604b58f.mp4?t=1763758286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the unknown - Discover the map with every action<br><br>The world begins in total darkness. Every movement, jump, or ability stroke reveals a new fragment of the environment, painting your surroundings as you explore. Your curiosity becomes your compass, guiding you through a landscape that only exists when you dare to uncover it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713500/extras/33b56fdacbeba9c322a029c613d2deb9.poster.avif?t=1763758286\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713500/extras/33b56fdacbeba9c322a029c613d2deb9.webm?t=1763758286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713500/extras/33b56fdacbeba9c322a029c613d2deb9.mp4?t=1763758286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astonishing painterly landscapes<br><br>As you paint the world into existence, breathtaking environments emerge from the darkness. Each new area feels rewarding to reveal. The world isn\u2019t just beautiful to look at; it\u2019s satisfying to bring to life with your own movement and color.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713500/extras/397479cc1f49da24d972d09d4612046f.poster.avif?t=1763758286\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713500/extras/397479cc1f49da24d972d09d4612046f.webm?t=1763758286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713500/extras/397479cc1f49da24d972d09d4612046f.mp4?t=1763758286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and progress at your own pace<br><br>Pain-T offers a relaxed sense of progression. You uncover new spaces steadily, without pressure or urgency, finding small moments of delight along the way. The journey feels fluid and engaging, curiosity keeps you moving forward naturally.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713500/extras/50bad5e8b130b2f387b80fd5dda8581e.poster.avif?t=1763758286\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713500/extras/50bad5e8b130b2f387b80fd5dda8581e.webm?t=1763758286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713500/extras/50bad5e8b130b2f387b80fd5dda8581e.mp4?t=1763758286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash abilities that open new possibilites<br><br>As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock abilities that reshape how you interact with the world. Use them to reach hidden areas, uncover deeper layers of the map, and paint pathways that were once impossible. Each new skill is both a tool and a key.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713500/extras/1a47c87edcaf5d9add83ae73c3db2ffd.poster.avif?t=1763758286\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713500/extras/1a47c87edcaf5d9add83ae73c3db2ffd.webm?t=1763758286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713500/extras/1a47c87edcaf5d9add83ae73c3db2ffd.mp4?t=1763758286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3713500?t=1763758286","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3713500?t=1763758286","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713500/0761e194c2fed828644ff9913e6da031600309d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763758286","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713500/0761e194c2fed828644ff9913e6da031600309d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763758286","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4198040,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pain-T is an exploration-driven metroidvania where color is your greatest weapo