ash abilities that open new possibilites<br><br>As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock abilities that reshape how you interact with the world. Use them to reach hidden areas, uncover deeper layers of the map, and paint pathways that were once impossible. Each new skill is both a tool and a key.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713500/extras/1a47c87edcaf5d9add83ae73c3db2ffd.poster.avif?t=1763758286\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713500/extras/1a47c87edcaf5d9add83ae73c3db2ffd.webm?t=1763758286\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713500/extras/1a47c87edcaf5d9add83ae73c3db2ffd.mp4?t=1763758286\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Wheel Of Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713500/af889aa44591ed72a3eec77be8b9bd4710bd8f97/header.jpg?t=1763758286","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3713500/581532995/cd0ae2da4044203363f77159395d9a058bd650ee/1762424489/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762429234","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3713500/581532995/cd0ae2da4044203363f77159395d9a058bd650ee/1762424489/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762429234","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3713500/581532995/cd0ae2da4044203363f77159395d9a058bd650ee/1762424489/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762429234","id":257134290,"name":"Pain-Trailer 02/05/2025","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257134290/71b2905f10cac25bdafc09295f161e490076149